<item><title>UN mission to leave Western Sahara by 31 January without holding referendum</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-without-bb564c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-without-bb564c/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>MINURSO spent 35 years without organising the vote, while helping monitor the 1991 ceasefire between Morocco and the Polisario Front.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:54:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-without-bb564c/share.jpg" length="43504" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-without-bb564c/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Russia vetoes US Western Sahara resolution at UN Security Council</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/russia-vetoes-us-western-sahara-resolution-at-un-security-695c80/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/russia-vetoes-us-western-sahara-resolution-at-un-security-695c80/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>The US-backed draft would have renewed the United Nations Western Sahara mission to October 2027 and put Morocco&apos;s autonomy proposal at the centre of talks.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:40:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" length="38182" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Former Algerian envoy warns Morocco could seize Polisario-held land after UN mission exits</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/former-algerian-envoy-warns-morocco-could-seize-polisario-0e75e6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/former-algerian-envoy-warns-morocco-could-seize-polisario-0e75e6/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>Ammar Belani says Rabat could use the scheduled departure of the UN mission on 31 January 2027 to extend its control across the separation wall.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:56:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" length="38182" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
